    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010020,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "グッズ濡れてないよね？　大丈夫だよね？　えっと……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あの子も雨宿りか……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……ん？　おおっ、すごいなあのカバン\r\n人気アイドルのライブ限定品がぎっしり……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010030,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "こっちは平気だし、これも……！\r\n……ん、全部おっけー！　良かったぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010040,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あ、すみません騒がしくしちゃって！\r\nうるさかったですよね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　ああ、いえ。大丈夫ですよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010050,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "それなら良かったです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "off",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010060,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……これ私の方が濡れちゃってるな……ハンカチは──",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0135",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あ。缶バッジ、落としましたよ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010070,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "えっ？　あ、ほんとだ！\r\nすみませんっ、ありがとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010080,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "良かったぁ……！\r\nこれ限定のヤツなんです、助かりました！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（──……いい笑顔だなぁ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……それに、缶バッジでこんなに喜ぶところといい、\r\nあれだけのグッズといい、本当にアイドルが好きなんだ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……この子なら、きっと……！）"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あの……すみません\r\n急にこんなこと言われて戸惑うかもしれないんですが……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルに、興味はありませんか？"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010090,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……はい？　アイドル？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうです\r\nあなたに、アイドルになってもらいたいと思いました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010100,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……え、えーと……いきなり何事っていうか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010110,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……あっ。お兄さんも実はドルオタなんですか？\r\n話せそうな人見つけちゃって嬉しいなー、みたいな！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010120,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "それとも遠回しなナンパです？\r\n俺だけのアイドルになってくれ、的な",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうではなくて……自分は、こういう者です",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010130,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "２８３、プロダクション……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あなたなら、素晴らしいアイドルになれると思ったんです\r\nどうでしょうか？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010140,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……あ、あははー……\r\nその冗談、今日イチ面白いです。本当は芸人の方だったり？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いえ、本気です\r\n本気で……あなたに、アイドルになってもらいたいんです",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010150,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……私が、アイドル……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010160,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "いや、興味はめっちゃありますけど……\r\n……え？　ほんとに？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当です\r\n一緒にアイドル、目指してもらえませんか",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010170,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……そ、そこまで言ってもらえるなら……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700002/1007001010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……三峰、結華です。これから、よろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
